OffShades - License & Third-Party Notices
=========================================

OffShades is a composite, derivative shaderpack for Minecraft: Java Edition (Iris / OptiFine).
Original additions, integrations, and modifications:
Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Ulyxx3.

OffShades incorporates code, assets, and algorithmic concepts from several upstream
projects, each governed by its own respective license agreement. This document
aggregates all applicable licenses and notices.


