4. Third-Party Notices: Solas Shader
================================================================================

OffShades incorporates volumetric fog raymarching techniques, biome chromatic
extraction methods, and lava surface rendering principles inspired by and adapted
from Solas Shader by Septonious.

Solas Shader is Copyright (c) Septonious - All Rights Reserved.
Releases and project page: https://modrinth.com/shader/solas-shader
Source repository: https://github.com/Septonious/Solas-Shader


